    <tags>cyprobe cybrium security cli rust cross-platform admin</tags>
    <summary>Passive and active industrial device fingerprinting</summary>
    <description>OT/SCADA network discovery and posture probe. Performs passive and active fingerprinting of industrial devices and reports protocol exposure and configuration weaknesses.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cyprobe).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cyprobe/releases/tag/v0.2.4</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
